stify="end"><button class="group flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-full rounded-small tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 text-nav-foreground" type="button" tabindex="0" data-react-aria-pressable="true" aria-pressed="false"><span class="sr-only">open navigation menu</span><span class="w-full h-full pointer-events-none flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-inherit group-data-[pressed=true]:opacity-70 transition-opacity before:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] before:block before:h-px before:w-6 before:bg-current before:transition-transform before:duration-150 before:-translate-y-1 before:rotate-0 group-data-[open=true]:before:translate-y-px group-data-[open=true]:before:rotate-45 after:content-[&#x27;&#x27;] after:block after:h-px after:w-6 after:bg-current after:transition-transform after:duration-150 after:translate-y-1 after:rotate-0 group-data-[open=true]:after:translate-y-0 group-data-[open=true]:after:-rotate-45"></span></button></ul></header></nav><main><div class="bg-surface-paper"><section class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 pt-6 pb-20 lg:py-32 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="overline mb-4">The LINK Experience</div><h1 class="mb-8">More Than Square Meters</h1><p class="lead max-w-2xl mb-8">LINK delivers hospitality-level service and daily quality-of-life infrastructure that turns &#x27;mandatory office&#x27; into &#x27;I want to be here.&#x27;</p><p class="text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-2xl">On-site restaurant, fitness center, wellness facilities, green spaces, and community programs—all managed by our dedicated on-site team who knows your name, not just your company.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-surface-inverse text-text-inverse font-medium hover:bg-surface-inverse-press transition-colors" href="/contact">Experience It Firsthand</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-text-primary text-text-primary font-medium hover:bg-surface-subtle transition-colors" href="/experience/amenities">View All Amenities</a></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5"></div></div></section><section class="bg-surface-accent py-12"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 text-center"><div><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-text-primary mb-2">4hr</div><div class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Response Guarantee</div></div><div><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-text-primary mb-2">24/7</div><div class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Support Hotline</div></div><div><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-text-primary mb-2">4hr</div><div class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Response Guarantee</div></div><div><div class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-light text-text-primary mb-2">24/7</div><div class="text-sm text-text-secondary">Support Hotline</div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-16"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><h2 class="mb-6">Everything Under One Roof</h2><p class="text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">LINK combines the amenities of a premium hotel with the infrastructure of a serious workplace. No vendor management, no external memberships—everything you need, on-site and included.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8"><a class="group block" href="/experience/amenities"><div class="aspect-4/3 relative mb-4 overflow-hidden"><img alt="Amenities and services" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel1.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h3 class="mb-2 group-hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors">Amenities &amp; Services</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Conference rooms, concierge, showers, parking—the infrastructure for productive days. Bike storage and e-bike charging are upcoming amenities in preparation.</p><div class="text-sm font-medium">Explore →</div></a><a class="group block" href="/experience/food-social"><div class="aspect-4/3 relative mb-4 overflow-hidden"><img alt="On-site restaurant" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel10.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h3 class="mb-2 group-hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors">Food &amp; Social Spaces</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">On-site restaurant, cafeteria, and social zones for connection.</p><div class="text-sm font-medium">Explore →</div></a><a class="group block" href="/experience/wellbeing"><div class="aspect-4/3 relative mb-4 overflow-hidden"><img alt="Fitness and wellness facilities" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel7.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h3 class="mb-2 group-hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors">Wellness &amp; Fitness</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Fitness center, showers, outdoor terraces, and wellness programs for employee wellbeing.</p><div class="text-sm font-medium">Explore →</div></a><a class="group block" href="/experience/community"><div class="aspect-4/3 relative mb-4 overflow-hidden"><img alt="Events and community spaces" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover group-hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2FlinkGenevaSecondCarousel8.jpg&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div><h3 class="mb-2 group-hover:text-text-secondary transition-colors">Events &amp; Community</h3><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">Networking events, tenant community programs, and bookable event spaces.</p><div class="text-sm font-medium">Explore →</div></a></div></div></section><section class="py-20 bg-surface-subtle"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-16"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="overline mb-4">A Typical Day</div><h2 class="mb-6">A Day in the Life at LINK</h2><p class="lead max-w-2xl">From the moment you arrive to when you leave, every touchpoint is designed to make work better—not just bearable.</p></div></div><div class="relative"><div class="hidden lg:block absolute left-[120px] top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-surface-inverse/30"></div><div class="space-y-8 lg:space-y-6"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-1 flex items-start"><div class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-text-primary tabular-nums">07:45</div></div><div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-1 justify-center pt-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-surface-inverse rounded-full relative z-10"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-10 bg-surface-paper border border-divider p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><h4 class="mb-0">Arrive by Tram or Bike</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Multi-modal choice</span></div><p class="text-text-secondary mb-0">Catch Tram 14 from Bel-Air—18 minutes door to door. Or cycle via the Green Way (opening 2026); showers are available now, and secure bike parking is an upcoming amenity in preparation.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-1 flex items-start"><div class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-text-primary tabular-nums">08:00</div></div><div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-1 justify-center pt-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-surface-inverse rounded-full relative z-10"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-10 bg-surface-paper border border-divider p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><h4 class="mb-0">Greeted by Name</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Hospitality-level service</span></div><p class="text-text-secondary mb-0">Our concierge knows you—not just your company. Package waiting? They&#x27;ve already messaged you. Issue with your floor? It&#x27;s being handled.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-1 flex items-start"><div class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-text-primary tabular-nums">10:30</div></div><div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-1 justify-center pt-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-surface-inverse rounded-full relative z-10"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-10 bg-surface-paper border border-divider p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><h4 class="mb-0">Client Meeting with a View</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Executive conference rooms</span></div><p class="text-text-secondary mb-0">Book one of 15 conference rooms. Panoramic views, professional AV equipment, and coffee service. Clients arrive impressed.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-1 flex items-start"><div class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-text-primary tabular-nums">12:30</div></div><div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-1 justify-center pt-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-surface-inverse rounded-full relative z-10"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-10 bg-surface-paper border border-divider p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><h4 class="mb-0">Lunch on the Terrace</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Restaurant + terraces</span></div><p class="text-text-secondary mb-0">The on-site restaurant serves quality meals daily. Privatizable spaces for team events or client lunches.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-1 flex items-start"><div class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-text-primary tabular-nums">14:00</div></div><div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-1 justify-center pt-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-surface-inverse rounded-full relative z-10"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-10 bg-surface-paper border border-divider p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><h4 class="mb-0">Focus Work</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Minergie air quality</span></div><p class="text-text-secondary mb-0">Return to your floor. ISO-filtered air, natural light from floor-to-ceiling windows, quiet zones designed for deep work. No complaints about air quality here.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-1 flex items-start"><div class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-text-primary tabular-nums">17:30</div></div><div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-1 justify-center pt-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-surface-inverse rounded-full relative z-10"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-10 bg-surface-paper border border-divider p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><h4 class="mb-0">Quick Workout</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">On-site fitness</span></div><p class="text-text-secondary mb-0">Hit the fitness center before heading home. Showers, changing rooms, and lockers for those who cycle. Leave refreshed.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-1 flex items-start"><div class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-light text-text-primary tabular-nums">18:30</div></div><div class="hidden lg:flex lg:col-span-1 justify-center pt-2"><div class="w-3 h-3 bg-surface-inverse rounded-full relative z-10"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-10 bg-surface-paper border border-divider p-6"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between gap-2 mb-2"><h4 class="mb-0">Flexible Departure</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Every transport option</span></div><p class="text-text-secondary mb-0">Drive directly onto the A1 (skip Geneva traffic entirely), catch the Léman Express to France, or take the tram. Your choice, every day.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="aspect-square relative overflow-hidden"><img alt="Concierge team" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Flink-atrium-2.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75"/></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="overline mb-4">Hospitality Approach</div><h2 class="mb-6">Service, Not Just Management</h2><p class="text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-6">Most office buildings have a property manager who visits monthly. LINK has a dedicated on-site team—concierge, maintenance, technical support, cleaning—who know your company, your people, and your preferences.</p><div class="space-y-4 mb-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="text-text-muted text-lg">→</span><div><strong>Concierge who knows your name</strong><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary mb-0">Not a rotating front desk—a team that remembers your preferences and anticipates needs.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="text-text-muted text-lg">→</span><div><strong>4-hour response guarantee</strong><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary mb-0">Issues resolved same-day, not same-month. Our response time is contractual, not aspirational.</p></div></div><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="text-text-muted text-lg">→</span><div><strong>24/7 technical hotline</strong><p class="text-sm text-text-secondary mb-0">After-hours support from technicians who know the building, not a generic call center.</p></div></div></div><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-text-primary text-text-primary font-medium hover:bg-surface-accent transition-colors" href="/about/our-story">Meet the Team</a></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 mb-16"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div class="overline mb-4">Future-Ready</div><h2 class="mb-6">Digital Building Experience</h2><p class="lead max-w-2xl">A modern workplace needs modern infrastructure. LINK combines proven systems with future-ready digital capabilities.</p></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6"><div class="border p-6 border-divider"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3"><h4 class="mb-0">Smart Access Control</h4></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0 text-text-secondary">Badge-free entry via smartphone. Grant visitor access remotely. Full audit trail for security compliance.</p></div><div class="border p-6 border-divider"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3"><h4 class="mb-0">Room Booking System</h4></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0 text-text-secondary">Book conference rooms instantly. See real-time availability across all 15+ meeting spaces. Cancel with one tap.</p></div><div class="border p-6 border-divider"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3"><h4 class="mb-0">Service Requests</h4></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0 text-text-secondary">Report issues, request services, track resolution. Our 4-hour response guarantee, digitally verified.</p></div><div class="border p-6 border-dashed border-text-primary/25 bg-surface-subtle"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3"><h4 class="mb-0">Building App</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Coming Soon</span></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0 text-text-muted">One app for everything: access, bookings, services, community events. Coming to iOS and Android.</p></div><div class="border p-6 border-dashed border-text-primary/25 bg-surface-subtle"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3"><h4 class="mb-0">Energy Dashboard</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Coming Soon</span></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0 text-text-muted">Real-time energy consumption for your floor. Support your ESG reporting with verified data.</p></div><div class="border p-6 border-dashed border-text-primary/25 bg-surface-subtle"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-3"><h4 class="mb-0">Community Hub</h4><span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-text-muted font-medium whitespace-nowrap">Coming Soon</span></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed mb-0 text-text-muted">Connect with other LINK tenants. Join events, share resources, build your Geneva network.</p></div></div><div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-surface-inverse text-text-inverse"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-8"><h3 class="mb-4 text-text-inverse">Infrastructure That Scales</h3><p class="text-text-muted/85 mb-0">Category 6 wiring throughout. Fiber optic backbone. IT rooms on every floor. Whatever your digital needs today—or tomorrow—LINK&#x27;s infrastructure supports it.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-4 lg:text-right"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-surface-paper text-text-primary font-medium hover:bg-surface-accent transition-colors" href="/building/infrastructure">View Tech Specs</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="bg-surface-inverse text-text-inverse py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-7xl"><div class="max-w-4xl"><div class="text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light mb-8 leading-tight">&quot;The difference is the people. When something needs fixing, it&#x27;s fixed that day. When we have visitors, they&#x27;re greeted professionally. It&#x27;s more hotel than office building.&quot;</div><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-text-primary rounded-full"></div><div><div class="font-medium">Facilities Director</div><div class="text-sm text-text-muted">International NGO, LINK tenant since 2021</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-20"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 max-w-7xl"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-center"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><h2 class="mb-6">Experience It Yourself</h2><p class="text-lg text-text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-8">Descriptions only go so far. Book a tour and see the service level firsthand. Meet the concierge, visit the restaurant, test the meeting rooms—verify our claims before you commit.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 bg-surface-inverse text-text-inverse font-medium hover:bg-surface-inverse-press transition-colors" href="/contact">Schedule a Tour</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 border-2 border-text-primary text-text-primary font-medium hover:bg-surface-accent transition-colors" href="/contact">Download Amenities Guide</a></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="bg-surface-subtle p-8 border border-divider"><h4 class="mb-4">What to Expect on Your Tour</h4><ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-text-secondary"><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-text-muted">1.</span><span>Meet the owner team who built the building</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-text-muted">2.</span><span>Tour available spaces and common areas</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-text-muted">3.</span><span>Experience the restaurant and terrace</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-text-muted">4.</span><span>Review fit-out options and timeline</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-text-muted">5.</span><span>Get verified data for your business case</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class="bg-footer-surface text-footer-foreground" role="contentinfo"><div class="border-b border-footer-divider"><div class="container mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-12 lg:py-16"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-16 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-extralight mb-4">Stay informed</h2><p class="text-footer-body text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md">Get insights on the Geneva office market, workspace trends, and exclusive invites to LINK events. No spam—just substance.</p></div><div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:pl-8"><form class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 max-w-xl" noValidate=""><div class="absolute -left-[9999px] top-0" aria-hidden="true"><label for="footer-website">Website</label><input id="footer-website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" name="website" value=""/><label for="footer-confirm-email">Confirm email</label><input id="footer-confirm-email" type="text" tabindex="-1" autoComplete="off" name="confirmEmail" value=""/></div><div class="flex-1"><label for="footer-email" class="sr-only">Your email address</label><input type="email" id="footer-email" placeholder="Your email address" required="" class="w-full px-4 py-3 bg-footer-