RmExDeD7nwzkbs\",\"/_next/static/chunks/4a58438ba2ff6dac.js?dpl=dpl_B69aL5VzzcUEupRmExDeD7nwzkbs\",\"/_next/static/chunks/c76a8909afe1725e.js?dpl=dpl_B69aL5VzzcUEupRmExDeD7nwzkbs\",\"/_next/static/chunks/1667947b265b7911.js?dpl=dpl_B69aL5VzzcUEupRmExDeD7nwzkbs\",\"/_next/static/chunks/80e50919a0cc427d.js?dpl=dpl_B69aL5VzzcUEupRmExDeD7nwzkbs\",\"/_next/static/chunks/252b762d44dba82c.js?dpl=dpl_B69aL5VzzcUEupRmExDeD7nwzkbs\",\"/_next/static/chunks/b3671a2684cd0502.js?dpl=dpl_B69aL5VzzcUEupRmExDeD7nwzkbs\",\"/_next/static/chunks/98d16422563065a0.js?dpl=dpl_B69aL5VzzcUEupRmExDeD7nwzkbs\"],\"Image\"]\nf:T45e,LINK Geneva announces a significant leasing milestone: 9,500 sqm successfully re-let in the past 18 months, with all four associated tenant fit-outs completed on schedule and on budget. ## Leasing Success The achievement demonstrates strong market demand for high-quality, sustainability-verified office space in the Geneva Airport area. New and expanding tenants include companies from financial technology, pharmaceutical, trading, and international development sectors. ## Fit-Out Track Record All four fit-outs during this period were completed: - On schedule (averaging 90 days from lease signing to move-in) - On budget (zero cost overruns vs. quoted prices) - With owner-provided project coordination \"Our in-house team and established tradesman relationships allow us to deliver fit-outs at speeds and prices that surprise tenants,\" noted LINK property management. \"This is the advantage of owner-operation.\" ## Available Space Approximately 5,000 sqm remains available for immediate lease, including spaces with existing fit-outs for accelerated move-in. For leasing inquiries, contact: leasing@link-geneva.ch10:T41e,LINK Geneva announces enhanced cycling connectivity with the upcoming Voie Verte (Green Way) project, scheduled to open in late 2026. ## About the Green Way The Voie Verte is a dedicated cycling and pedestrian path stretching from Annemasse to Satigny via Geneva city center. The route will pass near LINK Geneva, providing a safe, car-free commute option for employees cycling from both Geneva and cross-border France. ## LINK Preparation In anticipation of the Green Way opening, LINK is preparing secure bicycle parking and e-bike charging facilities; shower and changing r"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"oom amenities are already available to support cycling commuters. \"Sustainable transportation aligns with our building's Minergie certification and our tenants' ESG commitments,\" noted the LINK team. \"We're investing to make cycling a first-class commute option.\" ## Current Cycling Infrastructure LINK already offers locker rentals (CHF 180/semester) for cycling commuters, along with on-site showers and changing facilities. For more information, contact: press@link-geneva.ch"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"4:[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"locale\":\"en\",\"messages\":{\"++3yzv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Facilities Manager\"}],\"++x9n/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Relocations\"}],\"+/1PqY\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Building insurance\"}],\"+/RUuu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Neighborhood Guide\"}],\"+07uGi\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Energy-recovery systems, intelligent dispatching\"}],\"+0iaMA\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"On-site restaurant at LINK Geneva. Privatizable spaces for team events, client lunches, and daily dining. Cafeteria and social zones for informal connection.\"}],\"+0zv6g\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Image\"}],\"+1eXTt\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Long-term partnerships with local contractors, suppliers, and service providers. Stable relationships, not lowest-bid churn.\"}],\"+3AuYf\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"View Minergie Data\"}],\"+3SYNm\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Spaces with adjacent or nearby availability—ideal for tenants planning growth.\"}],\"+4qd1I\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"900 sqm\"}],\"+4zlcM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Including original system installers. Deep knowledge of HVAC, electrica