\"24+VRB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Bicycle\"}],\"267/0k\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Flexible Floor Layouts\"}],\"26bx0S\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LED throughout with occupancy sensors. Automated dimming zones reduce consumption without compromising comfort.\"}],\"29ATV8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Multi-Carrier Access\"}],\"2A3Lj6\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"In a feature article on sustainable commercial real estate in Geneva, Tribune de Genève highlighted LINK Geneva's approach to energy transparency and verification. ## Key Quotes \\\"Unlike many buildings that rely on projected performance data, LINK provides tenants with years of actual energy consumption metrics,\\\" the article noted. \\\"This level of transparency is rare in the Geneva market.\\\" The article featured interviews with several LINK tenants who praised the building's approach to ESG reporting support. ## Industry Context The Tribune piece positioned LINK as an example of how owner-operated buildings can deliver better sustainability outcomes than investor-owned properties optimizing for short-term yields. *This article appeared in Tribune de Genève on August 12, 2024.*\"}],\"2As1HN\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Employees want to work for companies that invest in their wellbeing. A Minergie-certified building signals commitment beyond words.\"}],\"2BNbJm\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"MEP Specialists\"}],\"2BkuiV\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Compare your current annual workplace costs against a right-sized, Minergie-efficient space at LINK Geneva.\"}],\"2CdELv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Your Office Is Bleeding CHF 180,000/Year\"}],\"2CucRF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Infrastructure \u0026 Resilience\"}],\"2E7wY7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Neighborhood Guide | Restaurants, Hotels \u0026 Services | LINK Geneva\"}],\"2EmZe8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Stores your cookie preferences\"}],\"2H+ZU7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Plan your expansion\"}],\"2H/zlo\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Partition installation\"}],\"