"value\":\"Total sqm\"}],\"36s+JC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The built environment sets the stage, but amenities support the daily habits that maintain wellbeing. LINK provides facilities that make healthy choices convenient.\"}],\"377ahA\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Category 6 wiring throughout. Fiber optic backbone. IT rooms on every floor. Whatever your digital needs today—or tomorrow—LINK's infrastructure supports it.\"}],\"38K2RB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"One property manager visiting monthly. When HVAC breaks, weeks to get fixed.\"}],\"3APrFI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Water consumption\"}],\"3BJY5F\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK Geneva home\"}],\"3DK/UE\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Transparency\"}],\"3DqmwH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"How Pricing Works\"}],\"3EOf6c\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Geneva HQ Location Scorecard\"}],\"3Fj18i\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"(\"},{\"type\":1,\"value\":\"count\"},{\"type\":0,\"value\":\" active)\"}],\"3Gezfx\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Space That Fits Your Ambition\"}],\"3GoTwY\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Partners \u0026 project management\"}],\"3GwN7k\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Multi-modal choice\"}],\"3HUcW3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Running groups\"}],\"3HtkDT\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Come Meet the Team\"}],\"3JiLV3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Anything we should know? (optional)\"}],\"3K2zoK\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Corporate Neighbors\"}],\"3KW6ez\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Professional advisors (lawyers, accountants, auditors) as required\"}],\"3KX25x\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Sitemap Validation Issues (Dev Only)\"}],\"3KnPAy\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Green Way (2026)\"}],\"3Mlm15\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"L'Oréal, Mazars, SITA, and other multinationals have chosen this district for their Swiss HQ.\"}],\"3MyAwj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Trading Firm Upgrades Client Perception—and Closes Bigger Deals\"}],\"3NHsqm\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Passed\"}],\"3Ny3Bh\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Your Answers\"}],\"3OqQyZ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Message / notes\"}],\"3PCUXF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Request our 10-year TCO model, actual energy consumption data, and transparent service charge breakdown.\"}],\"3Q5YYx\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Typical Growth Paths\"}],\"3R4Grk\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Our Neighbours\"}],\"3SECYR\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Verifiable Proof for Your Business Case\"}],\"3Sgvfv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"We're not optimizing for next quarter—we're building relationships that last decades. Our family ownership means we can invest in what matters without pressure for short-term gains.\"}],\"3W7OMu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Multiple coffee stations\"}],\"3WUwjm\":[{\"children\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A facility management arm\"}],\"type\":8,\"value\":\"strong\"},{\"type\":0,\"value\":\" was created specifically to operate LINK with a dedicated on-site team-not outsourced property management.\"}],\"3YmI3d\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Positive—they choose to come in when possible\"}],\"3Z2qj8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Scope 3 Support\"}],\"3ZPs5M\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Increase quantity\"}],\"3ZcC4b\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"100% renewable electricity procurement. Electricity procured from the grid is renewable. Verified consumption data for your electricity-based emissions calculations.\"}],\"3cQS1Q\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"View Technical Specs\"}],\"3ckr+I\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Negative—complaints about the space are common\"}],\"3fL36D\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Years of Energy Data—Not Projections\"}],\"3g6tec\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Chief Financial Officer\"}],\"3hj0u/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A boutique wealth management firm moved from a prestige address where service was an afterthought to LINK, where it's the foundation.\"}],\"3j/urI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Boomerang Architecture, Panoramic Views, Client-Ready\"}],\"3jxk5M\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"CERN\"}],\"3kGbyd\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Faster Fit-Outs\"}],\"3mvFjO\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Compare Office Features\"}],\"3mvL2Q\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"and\"}],\"3ngJR6\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Divisibility\"}],\"3nyGg8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK Geneva has been recognized with the \\\"Best Workplace Environment\\\" award at the 2024 Geneva Commercial Real Estate Awards. ## Award Criteria The award recognizes buildings that demonstrate exceptional commitment to tenant experience, including: - Air quality and environmental comfort - On-site amenities and services - Responsive facility management - Community and wellness programs ## Tenant Feedback The judging panel noted particularly positive tenant feedback regarding LINK's on-site restaurant, fitness facilities, and the responsiveness of the dedicated on-site facility management team. \\\"This recognition belongs to our entire team,\\\" said LINK's property management. \\\"We built this building to be a place people actually want to come to work.\\\" For more information, contact: press@link-geneva.ch\"}],\"3nzvr6\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tram, train, motorway access\"}],\"3oOSkv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Creative and autonomous work environment\"}],\"3obCiO\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"No cost for introductions\"}],\"3oliCV\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Periodic wellness workshops\"}],\"3r3xxa\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"2,800 sqm single floor\"}],\"3s2cxm\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Lobby\"}],\"3tA5oe\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Based on your priorities, other suburban locations score highest. While these can offer cost savings, verify transport access and building quality carefully.\"}],\"3tG2/R\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"You've heard the Meyrin / Pré-Bois area is 'hard to reach.' Central Geneva has 5–6 more years of major road construction—we're directly on the motorway. You've heard 'near the airport' is a problem—our sound insulation meets heightened norms; you can't hear a single plane inside. Visit and verify. Current tenants: L'Oréal, Mazars, SITA.\"}],\"3tWYAe\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Building-level data that feeds into your value chain emissions. We help you understand what's attributable to your tenancy.\"}],\"3thb5n\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Consent:\"}],\"3u2XtJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Please enter expected attendees.\"}],\"3uuSsF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tell us about your situation and we'll connect you with the right person on our team.\"}],\"3uyCHJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK is Ready\"}],\"3vY/4O\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Request Details\"}],\"3vdHJr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Current Availability\"}],\"3x5Jat\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Facilities / Office Manager\"}],\"4+0PjJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"New buildings have rotating property managers with no building knowledge. LINK has a dedicated on-site team who knows every system.\"}],\"41Gbmf\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"+30%\"}],\"41Xrv4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"1,350 + 1,350 = 2,700 sqm\"}],\"42GDCt\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Local Schools \u0026 Training\"}],\"434xxw\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Preferred time window\"}],\"445Cmy\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Energy Performance Data (3 Years)\"}],\"450Fty\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"None\"}],\"45Sw4e\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"For CFOs \u0026 Finance Leaders | LINK Geneva\"}],\"47FYwb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Cancel\"}],\"47gXu8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Visitor experience\"}],\"49tO0l\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Read how SaaS companies, financial firms, NGOs, and pharma organizations use LINK to support their growth and employee experience.\"}],\"4B3qzj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Add to Calendar\"}],\"4Bl4W7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"\\\"All Minergie Buildings Are Equally Efficient\\\"\"}],\"4CCQm5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Attendees annually\"}],\"4CrCbD\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Community\"}],\"4Eaz2F\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Aspect\"}],\"4IJHYj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Notable\"}],\"4IRHlu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"+41 79 203 58 56\"}],\"4IS3fS\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Sustainability Overview\