"value\":\"Mail \u0026 package handling\"}],\"5IpSYv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Limited flexibility, locked into current space\"}],\"5Jts5C\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Be the welcoming face of LINK Geneva. As part of our concierge team, you'll deliver hospitality-level service to tenants and visitors, embodying our commitment to exceptional tenant experience.\"}],\"5Jtwcr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"← Back to Newsroom\"}],\"5MDGuM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Enter your email\"}],\"5MJ4AA\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Uber/Bolt estimates not enabled. Open the apps for pricing.\"}],\"5NjPgr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tour the building. Meet current tenants. See for yourself why companies like this one chose LINK.\"}],\"5O+ghB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Service Response\"}],\"5OcA8E\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Arrange calls with current tenants in similar industries or roles. Real conversations, not curated testimonials.\"}],\"5OteMI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Knowledge\"}],\"5P9vAg\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Your inbox is flooded with broker pitches. Every building is \\\"flexible\\\" and \\\"modern.\\\" They all blur together.\"}],\"5PBiYw\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Compare Geneva locations\"}],\"5PcQeM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Fast request, flexible.\"}],\"5PhiOz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Same-day resolution, often within hours\"}],\"5Qb43c\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Join Our Team\"}],\"5Qz2gB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Interactive floor plans with divisibility options.\"}],\"5R2HBh\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Mazars\"}],\"5RjZzF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The hidden costs in older Geneva office buildings add up to shocking totals\"}],\"5Rw0I6\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"For CFOs evaluating office costs in Geneva. Hidden energy waste, service charge escalations, and ESG risk add up to millions over 10 years. LINK provides contractual guarantees, years of actual consumption data, and transparent charges you can verify before you sign.\"}],\"5SGnqT\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Timeline Comparison\"}],\"5TEzKB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Loading routes...\"}],\"5Tba7s\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"All Amenities\"}],\"5UUgAT\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Solve the Commute Problem\"}],\"5WQTtH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"When we built LINK, we made a choice that surprises people: we decided to keep it. No flip to institutional investors. No optimization for short-term yield. Instead, we built a team, established our own property management company, and committed to operating LINK ourselves.\"}],\"5X0ysG\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Current fit-out or turnkey to your specs\"}],\"5aR2jH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Continue monitoring occupancy data to optimize further\"}],\"5b3xNe\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Download high-resolution images, brand assets, and building fact sheets.\"}],\"5czuyn\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A dedicated on-site team means issues are fixed in hours, not weeks. 4-hour response guarantee for technical alarms. Owner offices in the building means service quality is personal, not abstract.\"}],\"5db6X8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"E-bike charging (upcoming amenity)\"}],\"5eNsz2\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"For Country Managers and CEOs stuck in decision fatigue. Every landlord promises 'excellent service' but you've been burned before. LINK is owned by a family—with proof you can verify: 4 fit-outs on schedule, 4-hour response guarantee, and clients who'll take your call.\"}],\"5eaKJN\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"By submitting this form, you agree to our \"},{\"type\":1,\"value\":\"privacyLink\"},{\"type\":0,\"value\":\". We'll respond within one business day.\"}],\"5fVzrt\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The curved, boomerang-shaped floor plan emerged from a simple insight: traditional rectangular buildings force offices to face either east or west, leaving half the space in shadow for half the day.\"}],\"5fo6pa\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"For power and data distribution\"}],\"5hmvG7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"1,350 sqm\"}],\"5lA5cC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tram 14 or 18, direct\"}],\"5lNk6H\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Started 600 sqm, now 1,800 sqm across 3 floors\"}],\"5lqt8S\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tour available spaces with the team who knows every option. Discuss your requirements and see which configurations work for your needs.\"}],\"5nS38J\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"from lease signed to keys handed over\"}],\"5ndV2j\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Institutional\"}],\"5oqNXZ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The electricians, HVAC engineers, and contractors who built the building are still on call. No learning curve.\"}],\"5ovZT4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Our full-time team includes facility technicians, hospitality professionals, project coordinators, and building specialists. We're a close-knit group that takes pride in what we do.\"}],\"5qCuAQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Mobile Coverage\"}],\"5r4+k7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Direct access\"}],\"5s2Mm7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tenant Case Studies\"}],\"5s4IA4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Data Protection Contact\"}],\"5sUZNK\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Conference Centre\"}],\"5suEJ/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Secure access\"}],\"5swh9p\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Have a Minergie plaque. No consumption data. Just architect projections.\"}],\"5t38vg\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"On-site gym, showers, changing rooms\"}],\"5tDmJF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A facilities lead's guide to identifying risks early and avoiding the common traps\"}],\"5tZKtf\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Private terrace bookings\"}],\"5uMKN1\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Staff complaints about air, parking, and amenities are constant. LINK provides transparent pricing, responsive on-site support, and reference visits with current tenants.\"}],\"5wedrF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"One tenant reported a 38% reduction in staff complaints about air quality after moving to LINK from a 1990s building. Minergie certification delivers measurable indoor environment quality.\"}],\"5xeOQn\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Maintains session state\"}],\"6+LNDj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Meeting room coordination\"}],\"6/aEFZ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Upcoming\"}],\"61AxC4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The LINK leasing team works directly with prospective tenants to understand their needs and match them with appropriate spaces. As part of the owner-operator structure, the leasing team can make decisions quickly without external approval chains.\"}],\"63cjzP\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"City Destinations\"}],\"65KUlx\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Building evaluation and due diligence support\"}],\"667o3D\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Answer tenant inquiries and direct to appropriate team members\"}],\"68kEIv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Secure bicycle storage and showers\"}],\"6ARq0n\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Functional Cookies\"}],\"6B5065\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Exact quoted price, zero change orders\"}],\"6B8j3y\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Building a business case for LINK? We provide the documents, data, and decision support you need to get internal approval. No chasing, no gatekeeping—just the information you need to make a defensible recommendation.\"}],\"6Dd5/E\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Questions About Our Policies?\"}],\"6Drdxj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Case studies, pricing \u0026 procurement\"}],\"6FYf4X\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Floor 1\"}],\"6GpL3J\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Reduced or eliminated fit-out investment\"}],\"6Hij83\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Workspaces | LINK Geneva\"}],\"6I2QY7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Access to WTC network, event facilities, and international business community.\"}],\"6INYm1\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Rainwater harvesting for irrigation\"}],\"6KFwJM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Badge readers\"}],\"6LBvOR\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Compare Offices\"}],\"6LfyZk\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"View Floor Plans\"}],\"6O14bf\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Three equal zones\"}],\"6OWR3v\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Clear Search\"}],\"6OuoNU\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Community Hub\"}],\"6QvdUQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Impact: Reduced downtime, happier staff\"}],\"6SNLbc\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"We didn't have to think about real estate. Every time we needed more space, LINK made it happen. That let us focus on growing the business.\"}],\"6Si4BA\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Open offices can be productivity killers when acoustic design is neglected. LINK was built with sound management integrated into the architecture—not retrofitted.\"}],\"6TychQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Schedule a Verification Tour\"}],\"6TzDBJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Talent Pipeline\"}],\"6U4jAz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"3. Use of Website\"}],\"6UDtlq\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Minergie Certified\"}],\"6Uf8RO\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Full details on transport, connectivity, and neighborhood\"}],\"6WFB9y\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Please enter a reasonable attendees number.\"}],\"6X8FeM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Current office feels dated or misaligned with your company's values—especially sustainability and wellbeing\"}],\"6XT3d5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Not Sure Which Role Fits?\"}],\"6XjTau\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Find Your Role\"}],\"6YPdhS\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Ask other buildings for years of data. See how many can provide it.\"}],\"6ZJwZy\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Do you only lease large floors or also smaller fitted suites?\"}],\"6ZNl/W\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Want real sustainability, not just buzzwords—mission-driven staff care about authenticity, and greenwashing won't fly\"}],\"6ZV7J4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Available for semester rental. Store shoes, gym clothes, and cycling gear securely on-site.\"}],\"6bgbLs\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"To be remembered as the CFO who quietly optimized a major cost center—prudent AND forward-thinking\"}],\"6cUkYd\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Critical systems coverage\"}],\"6d50E6\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Post-run lunch from cafeteria\"}],\"6eOHAS\":[{\"type\":0,\"value