ion Factors The tenant, a mid-sized pharmaceutical company with 180 Geneva-based employees, selected LINK primarily for its ESG reporting capabilities and verified energy performance data. \\\"We needed a building that could support our CSRD reporting requirements with verifiable data,\\\" explained the tenant's real estate director. \\\"LINK's 250+ sub-meters and years of actual consumption data gave us the confidence to commit.\\\" ## Fit-Out Timeline The fit-out is scheduled to complete in Q4 2024, with LINK's in-house project team coordinating the build-out. For leasing inquiries, contact: leasing@link-geneva.ch\"}],\"XNxNRN\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Partition wall ratings\"}],\"XOnBKN\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Category 6\"}],\"XPDhJW\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Building Features\"}],\"XQzjM3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Verified energy performance and sustainability metrics. The data your ESG team and regulators need.\"}],\"XUHxZN\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"2 dedicated per floor\"}],\"XUVwoJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Anything we should know? (agenda, setup, invoice details, etc.)\"}],\"XUvYRx\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Minergie\"}],\"XVTv/9\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"All distribution boards\"}],\"XWFviU\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Compact Floor\"}],\"XWJHUb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Available Spaces\"}],\"XXrQyE\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Barrier controlled\"}],\"XXxs1w\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Restaurant \u0026 Dining →\"}],\"XZ4X1D\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Administrative support\"}],\"XZ6qis\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Growth optionality.\"}],\"XZegeq\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Recently Updated\"}],\"Xa8ndJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Multi-Modal Access\"}],\"Xai6t9\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"When LINK was completed, we had a choice: sell to an institutional investor and move on, or stay and operate it ourselves.\"}],\"Xb21JQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Register Now\"}],\"XcRsvp\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tools \u0026 Calculators | LINK Geneva\"}],\"XcSSaS\"