 We have nothing to hide.\"}],\"YSsvfp\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Priority taxi service\"}],\"YTfBoU\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Support event coordination and tenant communications\"}],\"YTjvpJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Careers | LINK Geneva\"}],\"YTtJyi\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Quality dining on-site with healthy options. No need to drive for lunch or rely on vending machines.\"}],\"YV3kHu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Experience with event software and social media\"}],\"YV6EUA\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Request Quote\"}],\"YVgjEe\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"We treat our building like a hotel, not a warehouse. Every interaction is an opportunity to exceed expectations. We know tenant names, anticipate needs, and solve problems before they're reported.\"}],\"YWRBwJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Health facilities \u0026 green spaces\"}],\"YX17b2\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"These are estimates based on market benchmarks. Request a custom analysis for precise figures tailored to your situation.\"}],\"YYh8O5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"These cookies enable the website to provide enhanced functionality and personalization. They may be set by us or by third-party providers whose services we have added to our pages.\"}],\"Ya1fDN\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Owner-operated model means one call fixes things\"}],\"YbGnPM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Lockers: CHF 180/semester\"}],\"YbiLOY\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Natural stone\"}],\"YddOs5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Will the property manager actually help after you sign—or just hand over keys and disappear?\"}],\"YdlLcT\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"info@link-geneva.ch\"}],\"YeBuw2\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The building owners are on-site. Technical approvals that take other landlords weeks happen in hours.\"}],\"YeM9ZU\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• 50m to tram stops (Lines 14 \u0026 18)\"}],\"YeMMcK\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Direct connection to LINK\"}],\"YeefoG\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"1. Introduction\"}],\"YfIWIK\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Track record: 4 tenant fit-outs completed on schedule in 18 months. 9,500 sqm re-let in the past year.\"}],\"YfSt1y\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tenant provisioned\"}],\"YgoxmE\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tenant community programs\"}],\"Yh0Wx5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Good transport options, some limitations\"}],\"YhaWow\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"1 property manager (visits)\"}],\"Yie22z\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK sits at Geneva's transport crossroads. Unlike city center locations with one or two options, you get genuine choice—pick your mode based on the day's schedule, weather, or preference.\"}],\"Yl/1+d\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Reporting Time\"}],\"YnFehB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Professional development \u0026 talks\"}],\"YocE9r\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The Geneva Office Horror Story Nobody Warned Us About\"}],\"Yomoyz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Need a Custom Analysis?\"}],\"YrB0ys\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Try it\"}],\"YrrJO/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Transport Hubs\"}],\"YseRjw\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"33,000 sqm of proven performance\"}],\"YtRktv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Adjacent floor secured\"}],\"YueBIU\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Package handling\"}],\"Yuvn1c\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Contact the Leasing Team\"}],\"YuxbeP\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Fit-Outs On Schedule\"}],\"YvaJ2X\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Strong organizational and project management skills\"}],\"Yw1SNl\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Line 53\"}],\"YwQYQy\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"From Lausanne\"}],\"YxTWKa\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Hotline Access\"}],\"YxVYs5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Architecture\"}],\"Z/MaEN\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Create and manage the community experience at LINK Geneva. You'll plan tenant events, coordinate wellness programs, and build the connections that make LINK more than just a building.\"}],\"Z/P45E\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Facilities\"}],\"Z14rZ3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Space Planner Tool\"}],\"Z1JIhd\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"No single point of congestion. Distribute arrivals across the building—essential for high-occupancy floors.\"}],\"Z1SaCq\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"We were skeptical about the location, but the multi-modal access actually works better for our international clients. They land, they're here in 8 minutes.\"}],\"Z2opt3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Why Pre-Vetted Matters\"}],\"Z2zIp5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"24 hours\"}],\"Z3mKcR\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Review fit-out options and timeline\"}],\"Z4Te00\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Internal charge of lighting\"}],\"Z4l/F0\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Safari:\"}],\"Z5nmbX\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tools by Role\"}],\"Z5wzuK\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The Move That Saved a Country Manager's Reputation\"}],\"Z9/r4Y\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Wellness and quiet zones\"}],\"ZAr8/f\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Air Changes\"}],\"ZB0WPv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Mövenpick Geneva\"}],\"ZBQpMW\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Trained security personnel\"}],\"ZC/zi8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"View Tech Specs\"}],\"ZE8E8h\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Interactive decision-support tools\"}],\"ZE8jWv\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Presentation support for ExCo meetings\"}],\"ZEQUio\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Recruitment Advantage\"}],\"ZEikGJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Floor areas, ceiling heights, power density, HVAC specs, data infrastructure, structural load capacities.\"}],\"ZFszdm\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Required a defensible choice for ExCo approval\"}],\"ZI+sNM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Rapid growth meant the company needed to triple their space within 3 years. In Geneva's tight market, most landlords require 6+ month notice and offer no expansion guarantees. A traditional approach would have meant two relocations.\"}],\"ZIXaXr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Fluent in French and English; German a plus\"}],\"ZJubhV\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tram\"}],\"ZKdLdm\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Coordinate with technical team on efficiency improvements\"}],\"ZKx7zX\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Lines:\"}],\"ZM3XQC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• General contractor recommendations\"}],\"ZN4nmS\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Hospitality, Not Just Facilities\"}],\"ZOOWKu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Most developers build and sell. RI REALIM SA built LINK and stayed. Their offices are in the building. Their dedicated service team is on-site. When something goes wrong, you're calling the people who built it—not a rotating property manager who's never been inside.\"}],\"ZOn3VG\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Client Convenience\"}],\"ZPFhvr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Transit\"}],\"ZPj3OI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"HR / People \u0026 Culture\"}],\"ZPrEPa\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Natural Light from Three Sides\"}],\"ZQ2/hS\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"How to read between the lines and ask questions that reveal what you're really getting\"}],\"ZQxkE0\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Full-service office amenities at LINK Geneva: restaurant, conference rooms, fitness center, concierge, showers, parking, and more. Bike storage and e-bike charging are upcoming amenities in preparation. All managed by our dedicated on-site team.\"}],\"ZRuj96\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Your building is well-positioned for ESG requirements. Continue monitoring regulatory changes and consider whether your current data transparency meets future reporting needs.\"}],\"ZSTqXb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Amenities \u0026 Wellbeing Services\"}],\"ZTjwEa\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Who manages the architect? The contractors? The permit applications? You didn't sign up to become a Swiss construction project manager.\"}],\"ZURQal\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"VP Finance \u0026 Sustainability\"}],\"ZWT+mQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tram Stop\"}],\"ZXVk/N\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Pre-Vetted Partners\"}],\"ZXp0z1\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Features\"}],\"ZYJ1UL\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Answer 10 questions about your workplace setup. Get a hybrid-readiness score with specific recommendations for improvement.\"}],\"ZYVuE3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"24/7 recording\"}],\"ZYfexM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"You need 500 sqm now but might need 1,500 sqm in 18 months. Most landlords want long-term commitments on fixed space.\"}],\"ZcFpUk\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Original Tradesmen On Call\"}],\"ZdiqKM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Sub-Meters\"}],\"ZibE+c\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Terms and conditions\"}],\"ZkNOat\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK rent baseline: CHF \"},{\"type\":1,\"value\":\"rent\"},{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"/m²/year (Airport area benchmark)\"}],\"ZkiRAP\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Set an origin above, then click\"}],\"Zm6BKb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"4-star, 350 rooms, conference facilities\"}],\"ZmEJax\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Data \u0026 Verification\"}],\"ZmWlds\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Infrastructure \u0026 Resilience | Building | LINK Geneva\"}],\"ZmYwMf\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Get verified data for your business case\"}],\"Zmdh2x\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Fill in your current office details on the left to see a cost comparison with an optimized LINK Geneva scenario.\"}],\"Znuei8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Live Your Values\"}],\"ZpQ6us\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Result\"}],\"Zq18YL\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Read the complete analysis with detailed methodology and full quotes →\"}],\"Zqp6am\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Move-in coordination\"}],\"Zu3r8J\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"View All Testimonials →\"}],\"ZuP9kH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Swiss headquarters of the global beauty leader.\"}],\"ZujRXz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Office Size (m²)\"}],\"ZvKSfJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Events\"}],\"Zw+/xP\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"From Nyon\"}],\"Zw/Zn7\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Both options score similarly. The decision may come down to specific factors like lease terms, timeline, and landlord relationship.\"}],\"ZwC/3P\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Common Areas\"}],\"ZyXO61\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK combines the amenities of a premium hotel with the infrastructure of a serious workplace. No vendor management, no external memberships—everything you need, on-site and included.\"}],\"Zz0c6x\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Building Your ExCo-Proof Business Case\"}],\"ZzIaYS\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Dedicated freight elevator\"}],\"a0bGdr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Week 19-20\"}],\"a1HxSy\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Flexible office spaces from 270 m² to 2,700 sqm at LINK Geneva. Available now, with fitted suites and turnkey options for faster move-in. Divisible floors for growing teams.\"}],\"a391m+\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Reception and lobby\"}],\"a3vKCj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"International clients from multiple time zones needed efficiency\"}],\"a5msuh\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Yes\"}],\"a6Ed8P\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Editorial composite image of a single LINK Geneva tenant floor that gradually transitions from a clean black-and-white architect's line drawing of a small starter suite on the left, through a hand-drawn watercolor mid-section, into a full-color photograph of a vast LINK headquarters on the right — bench desks, lounge sofas with bouclé chairs, oak floors, white cylindrical columns and the building's curved panoramic windows looking onto the realistic Vernier landscape of mature trees and low-rise Geneva suburbs — visualising the architect's sketch becoming the realised headquarters as the company grows.\"}],\"a6lv43\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Changing rooms\"}],\"a7M3/H\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Years of actual consumption data, verified and reported.\"}],\"a7bT/V\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Estimated savings: CHF 8–12/m²/year\"}],\"a8cdaj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"CRE \u0026 Workplace Pack\"}],\"a8vrfQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Building-wide initiatives and social responsibility\"}],\"a9r1Zb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"35 employees\"}],\"aA3rX0\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"5,400 sqm+\"}],\"aBJG5j\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"4-hour response guarantee\"}],\"aCR