efit from Green Way 2026 Cycling Infrastructure\"}],\"abUUbu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"40+ Year Family-Owned Business\"}],\"acrOoz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Continue\"}],\"agOXPD\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Size\"}],\"aj4+JJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Response Time\"}],\"ajs3lD\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Responsive on-site team that fixes issues in hours (4-hour response guarantee)—not weeks of escalation\"}],\"akHMRD\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Staff complaints about air, parking, and amenities are constant—and you're skeptical of vendor promises after seeing too many moves go over budget.\"}],\"akI74+\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Meet the Owners\"}],\"al0x2v\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Download our HR Checklist for evaluating office environments. Covers air quality, daylight, amenities, transport, and wellbeing features that affect staff outcomes.\"}],\"albzpn\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Spots\"}],\"amCos/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Shower facilities and changing rooms for cyclists, runners, and fitness enthusiasts. Lockers available for rental.\"}],\"an2PB6\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Current Availability \u0026 Floor Plans\"}],\"apmdAB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"+\"},{\"type\":1,\"value\":\"points\"},{\"type\":0,\"value\":\" points\"}],\"apmqv4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"When your company talks about sustainability and wellbeing, your office should embody it. LINK's Minergie certification, natural light, air quality systems, and green design let you walk the talk—visible proof your values aren't just PowerPoint slides.\"}],\"apsmtP\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Owner-Operated Service Model\"}],\"aq+fsr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"24/7 monitoring\"}],\"aqUISF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The Boomerang Advantage\"}],\"ard2U4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"SaaS, software development, and IT services\"}],\"as0ak1\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Technical Documentation\"}],\"asZwmF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Group fitness or wellness activity\"}],\"atShTQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Requ