nd next steps.\"}],\"baKZsB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"3+ years experience in commercial building maintenance\"}],\"bavsRY\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Community \u0026 Social Impact | Sustainability | LINK Geneva\"}],\"bc89TX\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Future-Proof Infrastructure\"}],\"bcPfYJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Modern chiller plant with variable-speed drives. Individual zone control prevents over-heating and over-cooling of unoccupied areas.\"}],\"bgSFt5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tram 14 \u0026 18\"}],\"bgjNjG\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Contact information (name, email address, phone number, company) when you fill out forms or request information\"}],\"bhF6Ll\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK service charges: CHF \"},{\"type\":1,\"value\":\"charge\"},{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"/m²/year (flat) + provision for energy cost\"}],\"biGmom\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Choose Time\"}],\"biNzAh\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Digital booking system with real-time availability\"}],\"bkVXuz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"To each workstation position\"}],\"blPLs4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Meyrin Centre\"}],\"bmB64N\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"33,000 sqm of Proven Performance\"}],\"bnHtRO\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Skip the Construction Phase\"}],\"bp65Ti\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Minergie Air Standard\"}],\"bpCJX3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Divisible to 270 m² minimum\"}],\"bqggzI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Fitness center, showers, changing rooms, outdoor green spaces, and wellness programs—because employee health isn't separate from employee performance.\"}],\"brfnL5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"How LINK Helps\"}],\"bsFpcr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"We invest in training and certification. Several of our senior team members started in entry-level positions and grew with us over the years.\"}],\"bshsgD\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Smart Access Control\"}],\"btEcqH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tenant Community\"}],\"buFnIW\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"After-hours support from technicians who know the building, not a generic call center.\"}],\"buysv8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Location Profiles\"}],\"bvRNND\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Quick medical services\"}],\"bvS1G9\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"CFOs \u0026 Finance\"}],\"bwu2TJ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"5 min walk\"}],\"bxIK9P\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK Fitness Center\"}],\"byOAAW\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Process leasing applications and tenant requests\"}],\"byP6IC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Selected\"}],\"bzc0WH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Our green spaces are accessible to visitors, and our restaurant welcomes the local business community. Event spaces can be booked for community functions as well as corporate events.\"}],\"bznp5p\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Private offices (where installed)\"}],\"c+HSgQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Don't take our word for it. We'll connect you with other facilities leads—including NGO and corporate clients—who've been through moves with us. Ask them about hidden costs, responsiveness, staff satisfaction, and whether the reality matched the pitch.\"}],\"c+jXQL\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Meet the owner team who built the building\"}],\"c/hG2z\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"3 of 3 senior offers accepted after office visits\"}],\"c/wrYH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Job application materials if you apply for a position\"}],\"c2M8HI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Most Geneva buildings are owned by pension funds, managed through layers of outsourced property managers. LINK is owned by RI REALIM SA—a family company that built the building and stayed. Their offices are here. Dedicated on-site team with 4-hour response guarantee. When the owner's reputation depends on your satisfaction, incentives align differently. References available.\"}],\"c2f/Dw\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"50m\"}],\"c317kT\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Floor 10\"}],\"c33gjd\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Whether you need a single suite or an entire floor, LINK offers options that match your requirements—with the flexibility to grow.\"}],\"c6p8fM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Think Again | LINK Geneva\"}],\"c6qD8R\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"When processing is necessary for our legitimate interests and not overridden by your rights\"}],\"c72Mo5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Pre-vetted professionals who know the building and have delivered successful projects here.\"}],\"c74weT\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Built by Owners Who Stay\"}],\"c76/fG\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"All senior offers accepted after office visits\"}],\"c7af/P\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"WiFi Infrastructure\"}],\"c8cCJr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A fast-growing fintech needed European HQ space in Geneva. Typical timelines quoted 12–18 months. LINK delivered in 90 days.\"}],\"cA0kQY\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Cookie Policy\"}],\"cA8adH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Our technical team includes people who built the original building. They know every system, every quirk, and every solution.\"}],\"cB1Yck\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"CERN / Thoiry\"}],\"cCgZLB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Floor 11\"}],\"cDLqki\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Quick answers to help you prepare for the conversation.\"}],\"cEARar\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"How to extract real insights from tenant references—the questions that reveal truth\"}],\"cHcWjG\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"RI REALIM SA built LINK—and stayed. Their dedicated on-site team handles everything: consulting on plans, re-drawing layouts, permit support, contractor coordination, weekly updates. Experienced project manager. Engineer from the State of Geneva Energy Department.\"}],\"cI4oW/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Fitted Suite Timeline\"}],\"cIDexU\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Coordinate meeting room bookings and setup\"}],\"cIpOC3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Opening a Geneva hub?\"}],\"cKIIOH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A fully equipped fitness center available to all LINK tenants. Work out before the commute home, during a lunch break, or whenever suits your schedule.\"}],\"cRVVsA\":[{\"type\":0,\"val