ants expect. For more information, contact: press@link-geneva.ch\"}],\"dqB3hV\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"We believed there was a better way—and we were willing to prove it with our own building.\"}],\"dqOEsd\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Office Cost Calculator (TCO)\"}],\"drveK0\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"More Than a Landlord\"}],\"dtIpG8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Use our TCO Calculator to compare LINK against your current building—or any building you're evaluating. Factor in energy, service charges, fit-out costs, and timeline.\"}],\"dtdQ5f\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Showing \"},{\"type\":1,\"value\":\"count\"},{\"type\":0,\"value\":\" \"},{\"offset\":0,\"options\":{\"one\":{\"value\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"case study\"}]},\"other\":{\"value\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"case studies\"}]}},\"pluralType\":\"cardinal\",\"type\":6,\"value\":\"count\"}],\"dwGlaE\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Monitor and optimize building energy performance\"}],\"dx8ywg\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Terminal access\"}],\"dyt7Gn\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Thank you for reaching out\"}],\"dzffFS\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Fit-Out Support \u0026 Partners\"}],\"e/BgYK\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Event Details\"}],\"e/CnHO\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A selection of currently available spaces. For the complete list with detailed specifications, visit Available Spaces.\"}],\"e0FxAn\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"4hr\"}],\"e0pj/B\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Divisibility Options\"}],\"e1d4By\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Real stories from LINK tenants\"}],\"e1lKyC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Track Record Summary\"}],\"e1oyPA\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Standard office areas\"}],\"e23ACy\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Weekly yoga and fitness classes\"}],\"e38GOF\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Amenities\"}],\"e3X/8a\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Firefox:\"}],\"e6FfT1\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"To hand this off.\"}],\"e6Ph5+\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Address\"}],\"e7ZIBR\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Cornavin Station\"}],\"e8Te6V