ction using LINK's actual verified consumption data\"}],\"f+atNc\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Regular system checks prevent problems before they occur.\"}],\"f/3ivL\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Relaxed arrivals, better meeting dynamics\"}],\"f/e2Ox\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Green Way cycling path coming 2026\"}],\"f0eOob\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Experience the Difference\"}],\"f36QuC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK sits at the heart of Geneva's airport business district—surrounded by global leaders in finance, aviation, technology, and professional services. Discover who you'll be working alongside.\"}],\"f3KmKn\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Coordination\"}],\"f3s6cr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Schedule a tour and commute to LINK using your preferred transport. Experience the journey firsthand and see how the location works for your team.\"}],\"f4J+ju\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The Owners Who Stay\"}],\"f4Kkxz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Sub-Meter Data Access\"}],\"f4ODkl\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Select a floor to see dimensions, divisibility options, and current availability status.\"}],\"f52l/T\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"24/7 access to drinks, snacks, and quick meals for those late-night work sessions or early mornings.\"}],\"f74/uQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Every role faces different challenges. Whether you're evaluating costs, improving employee experience, building a business case, or managing facilities, LINK provides the flexibility, infrastructure, and services to support your goals.\"}],\"f7eOwx\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Experience with Minergie or similar certifications\"}],\"f7ltx/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Family-owned business means tenant satisfaction matters more than short-term yield optimization. That's why we guarantee energy performance contractually. That's why we deliver fit-outs on schedule. That's why our team knows every wire and duct in the building.\"}],\"f85hMf\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Learning Curve\"}],\"f9zp3L\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\