\"value\":\"Join the Ecosystem\"}],\"j1MA0B\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Combined service + energy charge: CHF 94.25/m²/year. This is a fixed, budgetable number—not an estimate that grows annually. We've held these rates stable for 3+ years.\"}],\"j2NUmd\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Case studies, testimonials, pricing transparency, and procurement support. Verifiable proof for evaluators building business cases for Geneva office decisions.\"}],\"j45ik8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Most Geneva buildings: one property manager visiting monthly. LINK: a dedicated on-site team including HVAC technician, electrician, energy manager, reception, security, maintenance, and cleaning. 4-hour response guarantee for technical alarms. Owner offices in the building. This isn't just a claim—it's verifiable. References available.\"}],\"j4DwCH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Calculation Assumptions\"}],\"j5TCbU\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"By registering, you agree to receive event-related communications. You can unsubscribe at any time.\"}],\"j5Uldb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Food \u0026 Social Spaces | Restaurant \u0026 Terraces | LINK Geneva\"}],\"j6T9PH\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Connected to Everything\"}],\"j7/tdz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Country Managers \u0026 CEOs\"}],\"j7It95\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"+ Others\"}],\"j8gt98\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Floor Explorer\"}],\"j9dNlT\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• Annual waste audits\"}],\"jAlolB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Multiple coffee points throughout the building. Quality espresso, specialty drinks, and tea options.\"}],\"jBBOBL\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Meet our partners\"}],\"jBC8x/\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"• On-site restaurant\"}],\"jBSFfb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"3 mo\"}],\"jFHzOl\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"For comparison: most new buildings in Geneva offer 40-80 spaces for similar floor areas. Some new developments have just 20-30 spaces. LINK's 423 spaces mean parking is never a constraint on your team's transport choices.\"}