icing works at LINK Geneva. Lease types, service charges, what drives value vs. sticker price. Build your 5–10 year cost model with transparent data.\"}],\"utkaJB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Try adjusting your filters to see more events.\"}],\"uuTnXk\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Your ESG Readiness Score\"}],\"uvfNXh\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Professional appearance and demeanor\"}],\"uvjgfC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Compare Geneva locations based on your priorities\"}],\"uwubng\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Tour the building with the team who built it. Verify our claims. Meet the service level before you sign.\"}],\"uxoRUc\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Less walking\"}],\"uyTmSr\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Booking, setup, and AV equipment support for all 15+ meeting rooms. Catering coordination available.\"}],\"uyd3UB\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"International conference center\"}],\"uys7Mc\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"See how our amenities, hospitality service, and transport options help drive engagement. Request a wellbeing-focused tour.\"}],\"uzDbdh\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Request Your Decision Support Pack\"}],\"uznj6K\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Geneva Connectivity Hub\"}],\"v+Zw3U\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"m² Public Green Spaces\"}],\"v+dYY9\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Secure bike parking on-site (in preparation)\"}],\"v+kqae\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Attract and Retain Talent\"}],\"v1fMUp\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"A1 to LINK\"}],\"v1ipl3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Room Booking System\"}],\"v3LGU+\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"On-Site Project Management\"}],\"v3OFF4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Service Level\"}],\"v5qihI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK's difference:\"}],\"v8d5DX\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"View Available Suites\"}],\"v8quiu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"For CRE Leaders\"}],\"v9aGwo\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Service, Not Just Management\"}],\"vA5Ho6\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Send me confirmation and relevant updates\"}],\"vA7hH5\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Ability to multitask in a fast-paced environment\"}],\"vAuVNo\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The owner-operated model means one call fixes things. No property manager middleman, no 'we'll escalate that.' Direct access.\"}],\"vB1Qhj\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Total Cost Calculator\"}],\"vCAGz0\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Common areas\"}],\"vDy+XC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Actual energy consumption data (not projections): 3+ years of history, contractual guarantees, auditor-ready metrics\"}],\"vE+hU2\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"ESG reporting support and cost analysis tools\"}],\"vEF59U\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Guide\"}],\"vFNEe3\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Timeline:\"}],\"vFdZ85\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Restaurant interior with terrace view\"}],\"vGzL3n\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Leads the tenant experience program at LINK, coordinating community events, wellness initiatives, and ensuring tenant satisfaction. A hospitality management background brings a service-first approach to commercial property management.\"}],\"vHL0ZI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"VIP\"}],\"vIsYkW\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Multi-floor options:\"}],\"vIwAJQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"See LINK for Yourself\"}],\"vJ9Cmk\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"These cookies allow us to count visits and traffic sources so we can measure and improve the performance of our site. They help us understand which pages are most and least popular and how visitors move around the site.\"}],\"vNnu4q\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"What's the typical lease term?\"}],\"vNnuNO\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Natural Light Optimization\"}],\"vPA8cM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK's boomerang architecture and panoramic terraces created an instant upgrade in client perception. The on-site restaurant became the firm's unofficial boardroom. Private entrance and dedicated parking elevated the arrival experience.\"}],\"vPbK0a\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"For cyclists, runners, and those who prefer an active commute, LINK provides full shower and changing facilities. Store your gear, freshen up, and arrive at your desk ready to work.\"}],\"vPkIGK\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Elevated CO₂ correlates with drowsiness and reduced cognitive performance. LINK monitors levels in real-time and adjusts ventilation automatically.\"}],\"vPxrQ+\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"LINK's full-service amenities reduce vendor management, support employee satisfaction, and make the office a destination worth commuting to.\"}],\"vRWmug\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Current listings \u0026 availability\"}],\"vRcrdM\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Get the detailed floor plans you need for space planning, fit-out design, or internal presentations.\"}],\"vTAKm0\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Logical Division Points\"}],\"vTH9s0\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Energy Performance (Verified)\"}],\"vU7L75\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Choose a tool based on your role or the decision you're making. Each tool produces actionable insights you can share with your team.\"}],\"vUw+fC\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Companies and organizations at LINK\"}],\"vWU+Jb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Technical floor and ceiling, perimeter HVAC\"}],\"vX4r6l\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"RI REALIM SA and LINK On-Site Operations Team (collectively \\\"LINK Geneva\\\", \\\"we\\\", \\\"us\\\", or \\\"our\\\") are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website or use our services.\"}],\"vZcPfu\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Book Technical Tour\"}],\"vZvUgI\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Proof \u0026 Trust\"}],\"va87F4\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"The Airport District Ecosystem\"}],\"vaERqQ\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Why Building ESG Matters\"}],\"vcCRUt\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Modifications and fit-out\"}],\"vcyRk8\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"CFO Decision Support\"}],\"vd8yYz\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Power per sqm\"}],\"vdvoMb\":[{\"type\":0,\"value\":\"Ability to expand/contract, divisible floors, 